armland-atlas/washington/pend-oreille-county"],["ARC or PLC in Pend Oreille County","/arc-plc/washington/pend-oreille-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years, same as August to September. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 26% of normal in June to July and 40% in May to June. So far in 2026 every published pair has come in under 90%, with June to July at 61%. On grid 33952 the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 14.4, an estimate from NOAA rain and not the final index.</p>"}
